59	/** WHICH PLATE. A region's own plate carries nothing that belongs to one place, since a Texan is not
60	 * told they live somewhere they don't: no city skyline, no refinery. A county with its own plate, as
61	 * Harris has Houston across Buffalo Bayou, stands in that one. A board may name a plate that lists
62	 * counties as `place_plate` only for a county it lists, which is how a story at a ship channel plant
63	 * gets the refineries and a story at the Medical Center doesn't. It may also name its region's own
64	 * plate, which lists none: a Harris County story out on the prairie stands in the Gulf Prairies rather
65	 * than in front of downtown, and the region's own plate can't put a county anywhere it isn't. A plate
66	 * of another region is refused. place_check.py resolves the same way. */
